The service scope covers the local Eersterust Cemetery and extends mobile teams to external regional burial grounds, including the Pretoria East Cemetery and the Garsfontein Cemetery plots. The firm offers custom task requests and regular care options, and provides digital before-and-after photo documentation to remote clients as proof of site completion.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'eersterust-grave-cleaning-group-eersterust' AND description = 'A business based in Eersterust, Pretoria, whose name indicates it offers grave and cemetery cleaning services. No further information was found online.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
